<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in heavy trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 157.11 to 6583.48.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 8.88 to 398.55.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.91.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 2138 to 538.</p>
<p>Volume was 555,727,090 compared with 475,927,360 on Thursday. The market was closed for Good Friday.</p>
